#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:217
msgid ""
"Choose <guimenuitem>Paste</guimenuitem> from the <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> "
"menu."
msgstr ""
"Välj <guimenuitem>Klistra in</guimenuitem> i menyn "
"<guimenu>Redigera</guimenu>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:223
msgid ""
"Click on <guiicon><inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"figures/button-paste.png\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>An image of the paste toolbar button.</phrase> </textobject> "
"</inlinemediaobject> Paste </guiicon> button in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på knappen <guiicon><inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"figures/button-paste.png\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>En bild av knappen Klistra in i verktygsraden.</phrase> "
"</textobject> </inlinemediaobject> Klistra in </guiicon> i verktygsraden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:239
msgid ""
"Right-click on the cell and choose <guimenuitem>Paste</guimenuitem> from the"
" context menu."
msgstr ""
"Högerklicka på cellen och välj <guimenuitem>Klistra in</guimenuitem> i "
"snabbmenyn."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:206
msgid ""
"To paste the contents of the clipboard (i.e., previously cut or copied "
"selection) to a new location, just click on a cell and use one of the "
"following methods: <_:itemizedlist-1/> The contents of the clipboard will be"
" pasted in the spreadsheet so that the selected cell becomes the top left "
"corner of the selection. This will also copy the formatting of the original "
"selection."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill klistra in innehållet i urklippet (det vill säga en tidigare "
"utklippt eller kopierad markering) på en ny plats klickar du på en cell och "
"använder någon av följande metoder: <_:itemizedlist-1/> Innehållet i "
"urklippet klistras in i kalkylbladet så att den markerade cellen blir "
"markeringens övre vänstra hörn. Då kopieras även den ursprungliga "
"markeringens formatering."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:250
msgid ""
"If you are pasting a selection which was <emphasis>copied</emphasis> to the "
"clipboard buffer, all relative cell references in all formulas will change "
"as described in <xref linkend=\"sect-data-formulas-references\"/>. The "
"selection remains in the clipboard buffer so that it can be pasted again. "
"The original selection will remain outlined with \"marching ants\" border."
msgstr ""
"Om du klistrar in en markering som har <emphasis>kopierats</emphasis> till "
"urklippet ändras alla relativa cellreferenser i formlerna, enligt "
"beskrivningen i <xref linkend=\"sect-data-formulas-references\"/>. "
"Markeringen ligger kvar i urklippet och kan klistras in igen. Den "
"ursprungliga markeringen omges fortfarande av den rörliga streckade kanten, "
"de så kallade ”vandrande myrorna”."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:260
msgid ""
"If you are pasting a selection which was <emphasis>cut</emphasis> to the "
"clipboard buffer, all cell references in all formulas will remain unchanged."
" The original selection will be removed from the workbook and the clipboard "
"buffer will be cleared."
msgstr ""
"Om du klistrar in en markering som har <emphasis>klippts ut</emphasis> till "
"urklippet förblir alla cellreferenser i formlerna oförändrade. Den "
"ursprungliga markeringen tas bort från arbetsboken och urklippet töms."
